// arrest_team: an armed suspect while a and b restrain s1 and s2 waits. Combat is the first tier: the free member
// opens fire; the reserved ones stay on their restrain, and s2 waits for a later planning run.
// method: squad_tick
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !open_combat c e1

squadmember a
squadmember b
squadmember c
roster (a b c)
enemy s1
enemy s2
near s1 a 2.0
near s1 b 3.0
near s1 c 9.0
near s2 b 2.0
near s2 c 3.0
near s2 a 5.0
surrendered s1
surrendered s2
reserved a
reserved b
reserved s1
enemy e1
hostile e1
